(Thank you. I will show the current SAHAYAK prototype.) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(I am opening Live Studio. The browser requests camera permission. When the hand detector) Tj
T*
(sees a hand, the page can draw landmark annotations. The current model then attempts to) Tj
T*
(classify the extracted features. Please remember that this is a prototype and only its) Tj
T*
(trained labels are supported.) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(I will make one sign that is listed as supported and hold it clearly in the camera view.) Tj
T*
(We should look at three things: whether the hand is detected, whether the prediction) Tj
