T*
(signs, sensitivity to lighting and camera position, and the need for broader testing with) Tj
T*
(different signers. Full sign language includes movement, facial expression, body posture,) Tj
T*
(grammar, and context; our prototype does not capture all of that.) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
